<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Telecom equipment stocks started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Telecom equipment stocks started.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>SoundView Financial Group said analyst Chandan Sarkar initiated coverage of two telecommunications equipment stocks.</p>
<p>-- put short-term buy and long-term hold rating on ADC Telecommunications Inc, with a 12-month price target of $50.</p>
<p>-- the stock was up 1-3/16 to 38-1/16.</p>
<p>-- put short-term buy and long-term hold rating on Digital Lightwave Inc, with a 12-month $16 price target.</p>
<p>-- the stock was up 1-1/4 to 9-1/2.</p>
</text>
